class:: Vseq
summary:: Pseq of visual events
categories:: Libraries>VisualServer
related:: Classes/Vbind, Classes/Pseq, Classes/Vrand, Classes/Vpar, Guides/VisualServer

description::

Returns a link::Classes/Pseq:: over a list of visual events. Each list item that is a link::Classes/Dictionary::/link::Classes/Event:: has its code::\type:: defaulted to code::\visual:: and code::\view:: defaulted to code::view::; any other item code::x:: becomes code::(type: \visual, instrument: x, view: view)::.

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
argument:: list
Events or instrument symbols.
argument:: repeats
Default 1.
argument:: offset
Default 0.
argument:: view
Default code::\default::.
returns:: a link::Classes/Pseq::.

EXAMPLES::

code::
Vseq([
    (instrument: \circle, x: -0.5, size: 80),
    (instrument: \square, x: 0.5, size: 60),
    \circle
], inf, view: \demo).vplay;
::
